Workspace for Changing Fonts

"Do the following once (i.e. the first time you want to change fonts):"
	Snapshot, quit Smalltalk, then in the Alto Executive, type the following:
		@Load Fonts.dm<cr>
	This will unpack the 20 font files from the file called Fonts.dm.
	Then startup Smalltalk as follows:
		@Snap<cr>
	You may now change fonts"

"Note: Font 5 is used for window labels, Font 7 for pop-up menus."

"Option 1: Biggest Fonts"
	TextStyle default fontAt: 1 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRoman24').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 2 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRomanD24').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 3 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'Helvetica24').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 4 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRoman36').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 5 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRomanD36').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 6 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'Helvetica24').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 7 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'Helvetica36').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 8 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRoman10').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 9 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRoman12').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 10 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRoman14').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 11 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'Helvetica24').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 12 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'OldEnglish18').
	TextStyle default gridForFont: 5 withLead: 0.

"Option 2: Medium-Sized Fonts"
	TextStyle default fontAt: 1 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRoman12').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 2 put:
		((TextStyle default fontAt: 1) emphasized: 1 named: 'TimesRoman12b').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 3 put:
		((TextStyle default fontAt: 1) emphasized: 2 named: 'TimesRoman12i').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 4 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRoman14').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 5 put:
		((TextStyle default fontAt: 4) emphasized: 1 named: 'TimesRoman14b').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 6 put:
		((TextStyle default fontAt: 4) emphasized: 2 named: 'TimesRoman14i').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 7 put:
		((TextStyle default fontAt: 4) emphasized: 1 named: 'TimesRoman14b').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 8 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'TimesRoman18').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 9 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'Helvetica18').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 10 put: (StrikeFont fromStrike: 'Frutiger18').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 11 put:
		((TextStyle default fontAt: 11) emphasized: 1 named: 'Frutiger18b').
	TextStyle default fontAt: 12 put:
		((TextStyle default fontAt: 11) emphasized: 2 named: 'Frutiger18i').
	TextStyle default gridForFont: 5 withLead: 0.

"Option 3: Create Your Own. The following fonts are available:"
	Disk filesMatching: '*.strike'.

"To update pop-up menu fonts:"
	Controller allSubclassesDo: [:each | each initialize].
	ScreenController allInstancesDo: [:each | each initialize].

"To update window text font gridding:"
	"Close and recreate all Views (Transcript, Browser, FileList, etc.)"
	StringHolderView openSystemWorkspace.

"To find out what the current font set is, select and bug printit:"
	(1 to: 12) collect: [:i | (TextStyle default fontAt: i) familySizeFace].

"To restore the original font set:"
	Text initDefaultFontsAndStyle.
